1555198, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxbzy.jpg"}], "slug": "macabre--1", "storyline": "MACABRE is a stealth-based EXTRACTION HORROR game set inside a collapsing time Rift \u2014 an unstable anomaly where TIMELINES SHIFT, ENVIRONMENTS RECONFIGURE, and a SHAPE-SHIFTING TERROR adapts to your every move.\n\nEach session is PROCEDURALLY GENERATED, with RANDOMISED MAPS, OBJECTIVES, and MONSTER BEHAVIOURS that force you to stay alert and adapt. Scavenge rare resources, build up your gear, and work to stabilise the Rift before it collapses.\n\nSURVIVAL ISN\u2019T GUARANTEED. You can ESCAPE TOGETHER \u2014 or cut your losses and LEAVE OTHERS BEHIND. TRUST IS OPTIONAL. BETRAYAL IS EASY.\n\nOne truth remains\u2026 IT\u2019S MACABRE.", "summary": "A four-player co-op nightmare where you must outsmart a monster that adapts to your every move. Enter a volatile time rift, craft and upgrade gear to survive, and face shifting objectives on procedural maps. Will you band together, or betray your friends for the lion\u2019s share of the loot?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/macabre--1", "videos": [{"id": 91733, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "5aGqGZzyZjs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5aGqGZzyZjs", "title": "Macabre - Game Reveal Trailer | PC Gaming Show 2023", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5aGqGZzyZjs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 101638, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "CuqihbUS_YE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CuqihbUS_YE", "title": "Macabre - NEW Official Gameplay Trailer - [4K 60PFS]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CuqihbUS_YE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 153257, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "oryrp_VLOzI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oryrp_VLOzI", "title": "Macabre Demo Trailer - Available on Steam June 9", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oryrp_VLOzI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {